{"title":"Career Roadmap · Conference Organizer","role":"Conference Organizer","summary":"A Conference Organizer plans and executes conferences, conventions, seminars, summits, academic events, corporate meetings and professional gatherings. The role combines event planning, project management, venue operations, speaker coordination, sponsorship, budgeting, registration, marketing, technology and on-site execution.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Conference Organizer plans and executes conferences, conventions, seminars, summits, academic events, corporate meetings and professional gatherings. The role combines event planning, project management, venue operations, speaker coordination, sponsorship, budgeting, registration, marketing, technology and on-site execution."},{"type":"p","text":"A BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration provides a strong foundation in hospitality operations, guest management, food & beverage, venue operations and service standards. BTTM also provides relevant tourism and event exposure."},{"type":"p","text":"A dedicated Event Management specialisation is the most directly aligned route."},{"type":"p","text":"Conference organisation is highly execution-oriented. Therefore, live event experience and a portfolio of completed events are particularly important."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Event Intern","Event Coordinator","Conference Organizer/Executive","Event Manager","Senior Event Manager","Conference Director / Head of Events"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build event planning, hospitality, vendor, technology and communication skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Event/Conference Coordinator → Conference Organizer → Event Executive"}],[{"